## Summary
The GDC Festival of Gaming has announced updates for its 2027 event, featuring the addition of a new Business Hall at Moscone West. These changes are intended to enhance the structure and business opportunities for attendees.

## Key Points
- GDC Festival of Gaming announces changes to its 2027 event
- A new Business Hall will be located at Moscone West
- The updates focus on improving business opportunities at the conference


